Subject: [PATCH] mfd: regulator: Add the Apple PMU and its power switches

Imported unchanged from Project Cascadia (https://github.com/rzxvx/Project-Cascadia) at c20b85e:
  patches/files-sandcastle-port/drivers/mfd/apple-pmu-i2c.c
