Cascadia history of these files: rzxvx <rrzxznewid@gmail.com> (10 commits).

The S5L8940X drivers here are Cascadia ports of Corellium's Project
Sandcastle (https://github.com/corellium/linux-sandcastle,
sandcastle-5.4, GPL-2.0); their copyright headers name Corellium and the
drivers they were based on.

